  m_Name: TutorialTopic_Development
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Features.Tutorial.Data.TutorialTopicData
  <Title>k__BackingField: Town Development
  <Chapters>k__BackingField:
  - <Title>k__BackingField: Development Trend
    <Description>k__BackingField: "Each town has a development gauge that reflects
      its growth over time. Supplying foreign goods and building production increases
      the town\u2019s development trend."
    <Image>k__BackingField: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 65dc82cb32e094343af93995340cd60b, type: 3}
  - <Title>k__BackingField: Raising Development
    <Description>k__BackingField: "Supplying foreign goods and building production
      increases the town\u2019s development trend."
    <Image>k__BackingField: {fileID: 2800000, guid: dd099d06149733f4da819730487e7397, type: 3}
  - <Title>k__BackingField: Milestones & Growth
    <Description>k__BackingField: Reaching development milestones increases the towns
      stats and unlocks new opportunities.
    <Image>k__BackingField: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 5283cf0602f9e1f4fa3de6fa522ef20b, type: 3}
  - <Title>k__BackingField: Town Upgrades
    <Description>k__BackingField: At development tier 100, the town is ready to be
      upgraded to the next tier. Supply the required goods and progress the town
      to the next level!
    <Image>k__BackingField: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 7dfecc8add197ff4387bdfb6cf0ebf06, type: 3}
